{"v":4,"catch":"Vasilis是一款手繪冒險遊戲。","desc":"主角瓦西利斯（Vasilis）在叛亂的市中心失去了丈夫彼得。 這個城市由於持續的騷亂陷入混亂，幾乎每天都有東西被燒毀或有人被殺。\n\n該中心已被政府遺棄，現在由當地工人和學生主導，他們能夠建造四座塔樓，使死者重獲生機。\n\nVasilis是一款專注於角色和故事的遊戲。 它分為五個章節，玩家將在其中處理暴動，邪教和殘酷的戰爭事件。\n\n該遊戲的靈感來自2014年的烏克蘭政治事件。","publisher":"Sometimes You","release":"2020-02-27","genres":["冒險","益智","其他"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文","俄文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 1.9GB / Switch 1.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/886ae269e85911ca7403d8397f3686c1d1c2d0333aa6f53dff5c322b4930c287.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79948f680a26c82101efc0fb524752bd5ca42ee53210801622b97bb51748d032.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/24f53d06d54578eb936457b9d7714ff75c6ef94a3596d30349aa8228c2bd4f54.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a5c7594a54f03b43a4bef0f29f345051b1e24ed6fc483d633539e725558cdaff.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c01fb0b13bb7654232a65bae3611897afda3aed722347cda5ea71565c37ecc68.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ea115769db7b5cc00331f5cb16cc4be5957e9bb4ae21f282a9d203de6fd31e5.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ad300e4fa000","dlc":[]}